<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 223 0 R
/E (With 30 years of expertise in heavy-lift and project cargo port logistics and active in the marine renewable energy sector since 2011, SOGEBRAS is your preferred partner for port logistics: with locations in Saint-Nazaire and Nantes, and throughout France via Maritime Kuhn and SOGENA, we support you across the entire logistics chain to meet your needs: port handling, ship agency services, warehousing, and customs management. With our experience in both fixed and floating offshore wind energy \(having handled nearly 540 turbines\), our team is at your disposal to provide advice and expertise throughout your project.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [1]
>>
