773 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 225 0 R
/E (Centrale Nantes, a leading engineering school, is one of the key players in research, innovation and education in marine renewable energy. Backed by more than 30 years of expertise, Centrale Nantes combines ocean engineering testing facilities that are unique in Europe with recognised know-how spanning modelling, simulation and experimental testing, serving energy production systems, their control systems, grid integration and system durability. This expertise feeds into its educational offer, from the engineering curriculums to dedicated executive education programmes and supports innovative projects in close collaboration with economic stakeholders and the WEAMEC dynamic in the Pays de la Loire region)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
