/E (Gustave Eiffel University leverages a wide range of expertise in civil engineering for maritime structures and Marine Renewable Energies \(MRE\): materials \(concrete, metallic materials, composite materials and bonded assemblies, etc.\), geotechnics and geophysics, structures \(behavior, durability, cables, scour, etc.\), instrumentation and non-destructive testing \(ultrasound, acoustic monitoring, surface waves, optical fibers, electromagnetic techniques, infrared thermography, resistivity, etc.\), environment \(acoustic assessment, sediment transport, life cycle analysis\), etc. )
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [6]
>>
